  "type": "anime",
  "title": "被遗弃圣女的异世界美食之旅 用隐藏技能召唤了露营车",
  "original_title": "beiyiqishengnvdeyishijiemeishizhilvyongyincangjinengzhaohuanliaoluyingche",
  "year": 2026,
  "category": "日韩动漫",
